maverick dev — the team's living knowledge graph

USAGE
  maverick [FLAGS] <command> [args...]

FLAGS
  --target <dev|staging|prod>  target environment (default: from MAVERICK_TARGET or config)
  --json                        emit JSON (for scripting)
  --timeout <duration>          command timeout (default: 30s)
  --quiet                       suppress decor

READ COMMANDS (native, no toolchain needed)
  ask          semantic search against the graph (hosted embed endpoint)
  config       show or init the maverick config file
  doctor       ping the graph, surface connection errors
  export-guide render :ContributorGuide sections to CONTRIBUTING.md
  health       invariant + autonomous-score summary
  help         print help text
  shell        run a read-only Cypher query (write verbs refused)
  status       graph vitals (Being count, target, timestamp)
  uninstall    remove all maverick global Claude Code changes
  version      print binary version + build time

WRITE / ORCHESTRATION COMMANDS (require maverick-dev on PATH)
  bootstrap    load Protocol cypher files into graph (writer)
  dream        run a dream round — cross-scale pattern discovery
  drift        report drift between local and a remote target
  dump         snapshot the graph to a .dump file
  fork         fork maverick-dev into maverick-local with APOC export/import
  ingest-repo  ingest a git repo history as :Commit/:Author/:File nodes
  inject       inject a protocol or signal into the graph
  migrate      apply a migration plan
  restore      restore the graph from a .dump file
  start        register the APOC heartbeat job
  stop         cancel the APOC heartbeat job
  swarm        parallel cypher workers — zero-LLM multi-agent
  sync         sync a local target from prod/dev
  target       switch or list configured targets

For contributor setup (needed only for the write commands), see
docs/contributor-setup.md in the maverick repo.

VersionStamp: dev
